# Medusa candidate: H2 Tripo originals are not committed - decision to pin raw Tripo outputs by sha256, not by
# size (tex8k-pbr 69.2 MB is over the 50 MB rule; parts17 44.7 MB is under it and excluded by the same decision); pinned
# by sha256/bytes in source-specs/tripo-40c4d1cd-h2.json and 20260929-h2-tripo/reports/tripo-run.json.
